            This appears for instance as (
            %a{:href => "#Johnstone"}> Johnstone, C1.1 lemma 1.1.8
            ).
          %h3#structure_induced_from_monoidal_functors Structure induced from monoidal functors
          %p
            If
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
                  %mo :
                  %mi C
