          %h2#references References
          %p
            A general discussion of categories of monoids in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+monoidal+categories"} symmetric monoidal categories
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Porst
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hans+Porst"}> Hans Porst
