              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uic.edu/~bshipley/monoidal.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p Some remarks on commutative monoids are in section C1.1 of
          %ul
            %li#Johnstone
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Johnstone"}> Peter Johnstone
